[h1]Welcome to the Official Project Vigilance Collection[/h1]
[b]Targeting RimWorld 1.7 (Waylith Engine)[/b]

[b]Project Vigilance[/b] is a modular systems overhaul bringing the strategic depth, planetary paranoia, and technological escalation of classic X-COM to RimWorld.

[hr][/hr]

[h2]Design Philosophy[/h2]

[list]
[*] [b]Decoupled Modular Suite:[/b] Every system is packaged as an independent module anchored on [i]Project Vigilance - Core Framework[/i]. Drop [i]Geoscape[/i], [i]Orbital[/i], [i]Aquatics[/i], or [i]Thermal[/i] into any vanilla, medieval, industrial, or spacer playthrough without alien prerequisites.
[*] [b]Unified Experience:[/b] Active modules interconnect automatically via soft interfaces and share a single unified [i]Project Vigilance[/i] Mod Options window.
[/list]

[hr][/hr]

[h2]Active Modules in this Collection[/h2]

[list]
[*] [b]Project Vigilance - Core Framework:[/b] Shared foundation library, unified Mod Options host, WCAG 2.2 AA accessibility themes, modder [i]DefModExtension[/i] contracts, and safe savegame migration converters.
[*] [b]Project Vigilance - Geoscape & Early Warning:[/b] Physical overland transit for raids, caravans, and visitors; 3-tier hierarchical Fog of War with GPU terrain culling; 3D radar & interferometry grids; unmanned listening posts & signal beacons; seamless Geoscape/Battlescape camera zoom; tactical ground interception, ambushes, retreats, and aftermath salvage.
[*] [b]Project Vigilance - Orbital Logistics & Satellites:[/b] Analytical Keplerian orbital flight with J2 nodal precession, persistent high-orbit hubs, live Comms Console trade windows, and dual-layer Surface/Orbit rendering.
[*] [b]Project Vigilance - Aquatic Operations & Sonar:[/b] Coastal hydrophone arrays, water-connected directional sonar propagation, and maritime outpost infrastructure (DevMode preview).
[*] [b]Project Vigilance - Thermal Integrity & Materials:[/b] Programmatic startup flammability audit preventing burning solid metals, all-metal machinery, radar dishes, and Odyssey heavy bridges while preserving batteries, wooden bridges, and Bioferrite fire hazards.
[*] [b]Harmony:[/b] Core dependency required for engine assembly patching.
[/list]

[hr][/hr]

[h2]Upcoming Modules (Roadmap)[/h2]

[list]
[*] [b]Milestone 1.6 — Planetary Expedition & World Integrity:[/b] Pre-settlement planetary survey phase, orbital staging reserves, blind-landing biome filter, Odyssey non-destructive gravcore takeoff, and codebase terminology alignment.
[*] [b]Module 2 — Interception & Rapid Response:[/b] Long-range craft scrambles, aerial dogfights, drop-pod rapid response, and tactical crash site recoveries.
[*] [b]Module 3 — Alien Containment & Biology:[/b] Stasis cells, live prisoner interrogations, autopsies, and the "Fog of Research".
[*] [b]Module 4 — Invasion Campaign & Planetary Panic:[/b] Planetary Council funding, regional panic meters, and Alien Doom Clock progression.
[/list]

[hr][/hr]

[h2]Recommended Load Order[/h2]

[olist]
[*] Harmony
[*] Core & Official DLCs (Royalty, Ideology, Biotech, Anomaly, Odyssey — all optional)
[*] [b]Project Vigilance - Core Framework[/b]
[*] [b]Project Vigilance - Geoscape & Early Warning[/b]
[*] [b]Project Vigilance - Orbital Logistics & Satellites[/b] (optional)
[*] [b]Project Vigilance - Aquatic Operations & Sonar[/b] (optional)
[*] [b]Project Vigilance - Thermal Integrity & Materials[/b] (optional)
[/olist]

